msgid ""
"Port ``mtx`` / ``rv`` / ``ulinalg`` / ``umatrix`` / ``vec`` usage to "
":mod:`ulab` (:ref:`the math-library removal <v3_7_0_mathlibs>`)."
msgstr ""
"Porta l'uso di ``mtx`` / ``rv`` / ``ulinalg`` / ``umatrix`` / ``vec`` a "
":mod:`ulab` (\\ :ref:`la rimozione delle librerie matematiche "
"<v3_7_0_mathlibs>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.7.0.rst:184
msgid ""
"Remove ``image.remove_shadows()`` / ``chrominvar()`` / ``illuminvar()`` "
"calls (:ref:`the removed image methods <v3_7_0_imgmethods>`)."
msgstr ""
"Rimuovi le chiamate ``image.remove_shadows()`` / ``chrominvar()`` / "
"``illuminvar()`` (\\ :ref:`i metodi di immagine rimossi "
"<v3_7_0_imgmethods>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.7.0.rst:186
msgid ""
"Update ``image.draw_image()`` calls to the new keyword signature (:ref:`the "
"draw_image rework <v3_7_0_drawimage>`)."
msgstr ""
"Aggiorna le chiamate ``image.draw_image()`` alla nuova firma a parole chiave"
" (\\ :ref:`la rielaborazione di draw_image <v3_7_0_drawimage>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.7.0.rst:188
msgid ""
"Review LCD scripts against the new ``lcd`` ``type`` / ``framesize`` API "
"(:ref:`the LCD rewrite <v3_7_0_lcd>`)."
msgstr ""
"Rivedi gli script LCD rispetto alla nuova API ``type`` / ``framesize`` di "
"``lcd`` (\\ :ref:`la riscrittura dell'LCD <v3_7_0_lcd>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.7.0.rst:190
msgid ""
"Drop the −128 bias when passing Y to ``yuv_to_*`` (:ref:`the yuv_to_* change"
" <v3_7_0_yuv>`)."
msgstr ""
"Elimina il bias di −128 quando passi Y a ``yuv_to_*`` (\\ :ref:`la modifica "
"di yuv_to_* <v3_7_0_yuv>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.7.0.rst:193
msgid "All other scripts run unchanged."
msgstr "Tutti gli altri script funzionano senza variazioni."
